---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title:
description: 记录技术学习、开发实践与阶段性思考的中文个人技术博客。
---
<section class="home-hero{% if site.heroImage %} home-hero--image{% endif %}"{% if site.heroImage %} style="--hero-image: url('{{ site.heroImage }}')"{% endif %}>
  <div class="home-hero__grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="home-hero__orb home-hero__orb--one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="home-hero__orb home-hero__orb--two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shell home-hero__inner">
    <div class="home-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow">MUJIAN · TECH NOTES</p>
      <h1>{{ site.title }}</h1>
      <p class="home-hero__subtitle">{{ site.subtitle }}</p>
      <div class="home-hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="#latest">开始阅读</a>
        <a class="button button--ghost" href="/archive/">浏览归档</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-hero__signal" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>BUILD</span>
      <span>UNDERSTAND</span>
      <span>WRITE</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a class="scroll-cue" href="#latest"><span>向下阅读</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
</section>

<section class="latest-section" id="latest">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">LATEST WRITING</p>
        <h2>最新文章</h2>
      </div>
      <p>从一个具体问题出发，逐层拆开概念、边界与工程取舍。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="article-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        {% include "partials/article-card.njk" %}
      {% else %}
        <p>文章正在整理中。</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-note">
  <div class="shell home-note__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS PLACE</p>
    <blockquote>技术真正变得有用，往往发生在我们能解释它为何存在、解决什么问题，以及何时不该使用它之后。</blockquote>
    <a class="text-link" href="/about/">了解这个博客 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
